+*   **Positional Encoding:**
+    $$ \gamma(\mathbf{v}) = [\mathbf{v}, \sin(2^0 \mathbf{v}), \cos(2^0 \mathbf{v}), \dots, \sin(2^{L-1} \mathbf{v}), \cos(2^{L-1} \mathbf{v})] $$
